{"content":[{"c":["ELIPHELET"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. One of David’s 13 sons born in Jerusalem (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.5.16","r":"2Sam.5.16","rawR":"2Sam.5.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.5.16","value":"2Sam.5.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 5:16"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.3.8","r":"1Chr.3.8","rawR":"1Chr.3.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.3.8","value":"1Chr.3.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 3:8"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.14.7","r":"1Chr.14.7","rawR":"1Chr.14.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.14.7","value":"1Chr.14.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"14:7"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Ahasbai’s son and one of David’s mighty men (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.23.34","r":"2Sam.23.34","rawR":"2Sam.23.34","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.23.34","value":"2Sam.23.34"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 23:34"},"); perhaps the same as Eliphal, Ur’s son, in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.11.35","r":"1Chr.11.35","rawR":"1Chr.11.35","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.11.35","value":"1Chr.11.35"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 11:35"},". ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Eliphal_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Eliphal_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Eliphal_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Eliphal"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Another of David’s sons born at Jerusalem but perhaps earlier than #1 above (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.3.6","r":"1Chr.3.6","rawR":"1Chr.3.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.3.6","value":"1Chr.3.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 3:6"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.14.5","r":"1Chr.14.5","rawR":"1Chr.14.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.14.5","value":"1Chr.14.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"14:5"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Eshek’s son and a descendant of Saul and Jonathan (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.39","r":"1Chr.8.39","rawR":"1Chr.8.39","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.39","value":"1Chr.8.39"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:39"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["5. One of Adonikam’s three sons who returned with Ezra from Babylon (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.8.13","r":"Ezra.8.13","rawR":"Ezra.8.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.8.13","value":"Ezra.8.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 8:13"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["6. Hashum’s son whom Ezra persuaded to divorce his foreign wife during the postexilic era (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.10.33","r":"Ezra.10.33","rawR":"Ezra.10.33","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.10.33","value":"Ezra.10.33"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 10:33"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Eliphelet","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Sm 5:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.5.16","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.5.16","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.5.16"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 3:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.3.8","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.3.8","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.3.8"},{"anchorText":"14:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.14.7","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.14.7","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.14.7"},{"anchorText":"2 Sm 23:34","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.23.34","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.23.34","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.23.34"},{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 11:35","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.11.35","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.11.35","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.11.35"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 3:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.3.6","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.3.6","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.3.6"},{"anchorText":"14:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.14.5","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.14.5","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.14.5"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:39","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1C